{
    "title": "All-in-one Calculator Launcher",
    "description": "Simplify everyday calculations with Calculator Launcher, an all-in-one launcher app for everyday math & more. Calculator Launcher revamps your home screen to give you instant access to a basic calculator, tip calculator, and a unit converter. Split bills with friends, convert units while cooking or calculate the cost of a home improvement project. Our free calculator app has all the practical tools you need.\r\n\r\nPlease note: As a launcher app, the layout of your home screen may change after install. Don\u2019t worry, all your apps are still on your phone - they just may be in a different location. To learn more, please visit our FAQ section: https://calculatorhome.app/about-us#faq \r\n\r\nWith a launcher app, you get the added benefits of: \r\n\ud83d\ude80 One-swipe access \r\nPerform calculations by simply swiping right from your home screen!\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udcf1Home screen widget\r\nSee the time, weather, and more, conveniently on your home screen with our customized widget.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\uddbc\ufe0f Wallpaper\r\nPersonalize your home or lock screen with a wide selection of beautiful themed wallpapers. \r\n\r\n\ud83c\udfe0 Home screen shortcut\r\nUse the Calculator Launcher shortcut on your home screen to get fast access to various calculators. \r\n\r\n\ud83d\udd0d Multi-touchpoint search \r\nApps and web search has never been easier. Search for installed apps or the web (powered by Yahoo) from multiple access points.\r\n\r\nKey features:\r\n\u2713 Basic calculator\r\n\u2713 Tip calculator\r\n\u2713 Unit converter\r\n\r\n\u2797 Simple calculator: Perform quick calculations with ease. Whether you're calculating expenses, balancing your budget, or helping your grandkids with math homework, this tool gives you precise results, quickly.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udcb2Tip calculator: Dining out with friends? Take the guesswork out of tipping at restaurants with our easy-to-use tip calculator. Customize tip percentages, split bills effortlessly, and show your appreciation for great service.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udd04Unit converter: Switching between units is a breeze with our unit converter calculator. Easily convert common units of measurement, like length (eg. mile to kilometer), volume (eg. gallon to liter), temperature (eg. Fahrenheit to Celcius), and more. No more scratching your head over conversions \u2013 let our app handle the math for you.\r\n\r\nCalculator Launcher makes daily math a breeze. Download now and easily handle everyday calculations from the free app.\r\n\r\nPlease write to us should you have any queries or comments about the app, including recommendations for new features. Also, please note that you can uninstall it at any time.\r\n\r\nYou give your consent to install Calculator Launcher from the Google Play\u2122 Store by clicking the button above. You also agree to this app's Terms and Conditions & Privacy Policy.\r\n\r\nGoogle Play is a trademark of Google LLC. Use of it here does not imply any affiliation with or endorsement by Google LLC.\r\n\r\nFor questions or feedback, reach out to us through our contact form: https://calculatorhome.app/contact-us \r\n\r\nTerms of Service: https://calculatorhome.app/terms-of-service \r\nPrivacy Policy: https://calculatorhome.app/privacy-policy",
